     2275       temp-list.fname format "X(40)"
     2276       WITH NO-LABELS SEPARATORS SIZE 26 BY 21 TOOLTIP "Условие для выбора чеков, которые будут добавлены/удалены/оставлены".
     2277   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2278        dsp-rs AT ROW 1 COL 1 NO-LABEL
     2279        B-print AT ROW 1 COL 89
     2280        B-hist AT ROW 1 COL 92
     2281        B-Help AT ROW 1 COL 95
     2282        br-option AT ROW 2 COL 72
     2283        B-exit AT ROW 2 COL 1
     2284        B-save AT ROW 2 COL 11
     2285        B-lkp AT ROW 2 COL 21
     2286        B-clr AT ROW 2 COL 31
     2287        B-macro AT ROW 2 COL 51
     2288        B-stop AT ROW 2 COL 55
     2289        B-clear-macro AT ROW 2 COL 55
     2290        B-record AT ROW 2 COL 55
     2291        f-tot-lns AT ROW 2 COL 60 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     2292        B-add AT ROW 3 COL 11
     2293        B-del AT ROW 3 COL 31
     2294        B-rest AT ROW 3 COL 51
     2295        CHK-STATUS at row 4 col 2 no-label
     2296        v-start-date at row 4 col 38
     2297        v-end-date at row 4 col 53
     2298        BR-list AT ROW 5.21 COL 1.25
     2299        sch-code AT ROW 20.5 COL 1
     2300        sch-chk-date AT ROW 20.5 COL 30 COLON-ALIGNED
     2301        sch-shift-date AT ROW 20.5 COL 58 COLON-ALIGNED
     2302        ED-notes AT ROW 21.54 COL 1 NO-LABEL
     2303        SPACE(21.36) SKIP(0.04)
     2304       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
     2305            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
     2306            TITLE "Список чеков"
